Toolkit assets (libs/toolkit/assets)
------------------------------------

Fonts, unmodified upstream static faces embedded by the toolkit, each with its
licence beside it in libs/toolkit/assets/fonts: Inter 4.1 Light, Regular,
Medium, SemiBold and Bold (The Inter Project Authors, SIL OFL 1.1) and JetBrains Mono
2.304 Light, Regular and Medium (The JetBrains Mono Project Authors, SIL OFL
1.1). The JetBrains Mono faces are also embedded by libs/assets for the
headless terminal renderer, with the same source files and licence.

The unmodified epaint_default_fonts 0.37.0 dependency embeds fallback faces:
Hack Regular (Copyright 2018 Source Foundry Authors, MIT; Bitstream Vera Sans
Mono Copyright 2003 Bitstream Inc., Bitstream Vera terms; DejaVu contributions
public domain), Noto Emoji Regular (Copyright 2013 Google Inc., SIL OFL 1.1),
Ubuntu Light (Copyright 2011 Canonical Ltd., Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0), and
Emoji Icon Font (Copyright 2014 John Slegers, MIT). Complete upstream texts and
notices are in libs/toolkit/assets/fonts/fallbacks. Desktop archives and native
images install these, the primary-font licences and the Lucide licence under
share/licenses/toolkit, through libs/toolkit/scripts/install_licenses.mix.

Icons, unmodified SVGs from Lucide 1.54.0 (https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide),
Lucide Icons and Contributors, ISC; the Feather-derived icons among them are
also Cole Bemis (Feather), MIT. Licence in libs/icons/assets/LICENSE-lucide.txt.
The toolkit's panel-bottom.svg is also an unmodified Lucide 1.54.0 icon,
as is accessibility.svg, used by Preferences' Accessibility page,
under the same ISC licence and attribution.
The screenshot app icon (apps/screenshot/assets/dev.mixos.screenshot-symbolic.svg)
is Lucide 1.54.0 camera.svg, unmodified, under the same licence.

Icon bundle (share/icons)
-------------------------

share/icons/scalable/actions/window-minimize-symbolic.svg,
share/icons/scalable/actions/window-maximize-symbolic.svg,
share/icons/scalable/actions/window-restore-symbolic.svg and
share/icons/scalable/actions/window-close-symbolic.svg are original MixOS
caption glyphs, copyright 2026 Mark Constable, MIT OR Apache-2.0.

share/icons/lucide holds 30 unmodified SVGs from Lucide 1.54.0
(https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide), Lucide Icons and Contributors, ISC; the
Feather-derived icons among them are also Cole Bemis (Feather), MIT. The licence
is share/icons/LICENSE-lucide.txt. The installer (share/icons/install.mix)
writes copies with stroke-width changed from 2 to 1.5 into the MixOS icon theme;
the sources are never changed, and each is pinned by SHA-256 in
share/icons/manifest.conf.mix.

Site assets (docs/_web)
----------------------

The mixos.dev web fonts are subsets cut by docs/_build/gen-site.mix from the
pinned asset set; each keeps its upstream licence beside it in docs/_web/fonts:
Inter, JetBrains Mono and Quicksand (SIL OFL 1.1), Noto Color Emoji
(SIL OFL 1.1).

Website interface icons are generated from the pinned, unmodified Lucide SVG
sources. The distributed SVG copies change stroke-width from 2 to 1.5 and add
a generated-by comment. CSS masks paint those copies in the current colour; the
Lucide ISC and Feather-derived MIT notices ship in docs/_web/icons/LICENSE-Lucide.txt.

